'''Snow Angel Twinstars''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]] event. They are the christmas variant of [[Twinstars (Uber Rare Cat)|Twinstars]], they now do massive damage to [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] and [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies. They were added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 526
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Snow Angel Twinstars
|name2 = Snow Angel Twinstars, type Φ
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Snow Angel Twinstars, type Φ''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Snow Angel Twinstars are useful against stages with a lot of [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] or [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies in general, though, like other rushers and their original variant, their below average range and health will often cause them not to last very long.

They can, however, dispatch rather easily any hordes of short ranged angels if paired with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], combining to make a deadly combination of offense and defense.

Their use is not recommended against [[Brollow]]s, as any bird who slips past their attacks can cause serious damage.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher}}

